# Line endings are load-bearing in this repository, not cosmetic:
#  - licenses/manifest.json records the sha256 of every vendored license text,
#    and scripts/gen-third-party-notices.mjs fails the release build when a
#    checked-out file does not match it;
#  - patches/aria2-embed-webui.patch must stay byte-exact or `git apply` breaks.
# A clone with core.autocrlf=true would silently rewrite both, so pin LF here.
*.txt text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
NOTICE text eol=lf
licenses/** text eol=lf
patches/** text eol=lf
